OL,3,ANorthern Lights stun UK down to
OL,4,AEngland's south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents across the UK were left
OL,7,Fstunned as the sky was illuminated by
OL,8,Fthe spectacular colours of the Northern
OL,9,FLights on Friday and Saturday evenings.
OL,11,FThe natural phenomenon, known as the
OL,12,FAurora Borealis, is the result of
OL,13,Fincreased solar activity.
OL,15,FSuch occurrences are mostly visible
OL,16,Fnear the Arctic Circle and northern
OL,17,FScotland, but particularly strong
OL,18,Factivity levels meant they could be
OL,19,Fseen as far south as Devon, Hampshire
OL,20,Fand Kent on Saturday night.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
